                                "sense_id": "406fda7f-ada2-38fe-aa18-1b759ad03200",
                                "text": "According to some, we should just accept our language being the subject of derision because you know; the lolz."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e190d078-4f07-41ea-aff9-ad9ea3a5ebd9",
                                "sense_id": "406fda7f-ada2-38fe-aa18-1b759ad03200",
                                "text": "Maybe he should just have some fun. While he could. Stuff the cabinet with a whole load of idiots. […] Just for the lolz."
